{"skill":{"slug":"chart-image","displayName":"Chart Image"},"version":{"version":"2.6.35","createdAt":1775716192948,"changelog":"Add x-domain support for quantitative and temporal charts, plus updated docs/examples.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"CAPABILITY.md","size":2146,"sha256":"37e6539d4fc58a9fe79c8ea5754ad9ae074152a11fde1b65f6326a2136162361","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.md","size":12173,"sha256":"d0467252bf8858bacbc29f5660d2e1c2fd7b434c1d0ac54941ccd31ef6870c6c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":15470,"sha256":"4200c6be0a3ae1c83fbdff1faf971dc61d970740ee165092ef9a86e9cb670fa1","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/chart.mjs","size":75611,"sha256":"3557d9389b6c02042695d9988ccfc90aacbe7b4b7a9235483c4c93b8d17659c6","contentType":"text/javascript"},{"path":"scripts/package-lock.json","size":52521,"sha256":"d2df3ce753d570286e971663926c5395ae9294701f9e687272d387ffe447e9a4","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"scripts/package.json","size":155,"sha256":"105d3ee33c2a9588e7b0587301fae5b17ec6592744d7c499132e0ab7941144bb","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2306,"sha256":"0b89ebd2109d8f8bdea06968d9297ade11e29c0a1d9e78aebc660b6869578cd7","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789023925690,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"a1ed982c9d10f4afbf639ab2f9e89b6c772e0d8cd4f134622d451352e9fc6bba","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/a1ed982c9d10f4afbf639ab2f9e89b6c772e0d8cd4f134622d451352e9fc6bba","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: chart-image\nVersion: 2.6.35\n\nThe 'chart-image' skill is a legitimate utility for generating chart images using Vega-Lite and Sharp. The core logic in 'scripts/chart.mjs' handles data parsing and image rendering without any evidence of malicious intent, such as data exfiltration, backdoors, or unauthorized execution. The documentation in 'CAPABILITY.md' and 'SKILL.md' provides clear, safe instructions for the AI agent, specifically warning against shell injection vulnerabilities by recommending structured argument passing instead of string interpolation. No suspicious dependencies or obfuscated code were detected.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779160338478},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":90,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":13,"checkedAt":1789023925690},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is coherent for chart generation, but it needs Review because it ships outdated rendering dependencies with current security advisories.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Reading input files and writing output chart files is proportionate to the skill purpose, but users should choose output paths carefully because the script writes directly to the requested path.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses npm dependencies and the lockfile resolves vulnerable-era rendering packages, including sharp 0.33.5 and Vega-family packages; current advisories list sharp versions before 0.35.0 and 0.35.4 as affected by libvips/libheif issues. ([github.com](https://github.com/lovell/sharp/security/advisories/GHSA-f88m-g3jw-g9cj))","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The invocation description is broad and the instructions include a hardcoded Israel-time dark-mode preference, but these affect chart styling and trigger breadth rather than giving the skill hidden authority.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The only persistence I found is generated chart files, including a recommendation to save under /data/clawd/tmp; there is no service installation, scheduled task, memory poisoning, or privilege escalation.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifacts consistently describe a Node/Vega-Lite chart-image generator that reads JSON, CSV, stdin, or a Vega-Lite spec and writes PNG/SVG chart files; I found no unrelated credential access, exfiltration logic, background worker, or destructive behavior.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Review before installing, especially on systems that process untrusted chart specs or publish SVG output. Prefer upgrading sharp and Vega-family dependencies first, and keep --spec, --csv-file, and --output paths controlled by trusted runtime code rather than free-form user text.","findings":"[SC2] expected: Downgraded: the README example pipes remote data into the local chart script as stdin; the inspected script parses stdin as JSON or CSV and does not execute it as code.\n[SC4] unexpected: Accepted as a Review concern: the lockfile pins sharp 0.33.5, vega 5.33.1, vega-functions 5.18.1, and a nested vega-expression 5.1.2; public advisories confirm affected sharp and Vega-family ranges, with Vega risks most relevant when untrusted visualization definitions are accepted or rendered downstream. ([github.com](https://github.com/lovell/sharp/security/advisories/GHSA-f88m-g3jw-g9cj))\n[SQP-1] expected: Downgraded: the broad trigger language matches a general-purpose charting skill and does not create hidden access by itself.\n[SQP-3] expected: Downgraded: the Israel-time dark-mode rule is arbitrary and should be configurable, but it only changes presentation.\n[SQP-2] expected: Accepted as a minor disclosure issue: the script writes to --output and examples repeat that behavior without an overwrite warning, but file output is central to the skill.\n[SC1] expected: Downgraded: package.json uses semver ranges, but package-lock.json is present with registry URLs and integrity hashes; this is normal npm packaging, though exact version pinning would improve reproducibility.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789023925690}}}}}